* SPICE Netlist
VCC 3 0 DC 2.5V
R1 3 2 ; R1 connected between node 3 and node 2
R2 2 5 ; R2 connected between node 2 and node 5
RC 3 1 4k ; RC connected between node 3 and collector of Q1
RE 1 6 ; RE connected between emitter of Q1 and node 6
Q1 1 2 6 QNPN ; Q1 NPN BJT with collector 1, base 2, emitter 6
.model QNPN NPN